'''Manaphy''' (Japanese: '''マナフィ''' ''Manaphy'') is a {{ct|Water}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

