==Trivia==
This card is featured in the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion's "Manaphy Travelogue" [[Space-Time Smackdown (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]] alongside {{TCG ID|Space-Time Smackdown|Buizel|38}}, {{TCG ID|Space-Time Smackdown|Shellos|40}}, {{TCG ID|Space-Time Smackdown|Lumineon|43}}, and {{TCG ID|Space-Time Smackdown|Staravia|133}}, whose standard illustrations all feature {{p|Manaphy}}; additionally, all four of these Pokémon are featured in the illustration rare print of this card.

===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Primal Clash|Manaphy|56}} from the {{TCG|Primal Clash}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Manaphy}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Omega Ruby}}.

